OL,3,AMacklemore dropped from Ed Sheeran tour
OL,4,Aafter 'Free Palestine' speech
OL,5,
OL,6,FEd Sheeran has not yet commented, and
OL,7,Fwho will replace Macklemore for the
OL,8,Frest of the tour is unknown.
